<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ meta.title }}</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f7f8fa; --surface: #ffffff; --text: #1d2330; --muted: #5c6577; --border: #dde1e8;
  --accent: #2f6fde; --code: #eef1f6; --marked: #1d2330; --row: #eaf1fd;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #12151b; --surface: #1a1e26; --text: #e6e9ef; --muted: #9aa3b5; --border: #2c3240;
    --accent: #6b9cff; --code: #232836; --marked: #e6e9ef; --row: #25314a;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
a { color: var(--accent); }
header { background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 16px; }
header h1 { margin: 0 0 2px; font-size: 1.4rem; }
header p { margin: 2px 0; color: var(--muted); }
main { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px 16px 40px; }
section, aside { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
h3 { margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 18px; align-items: flex-end; }
.controls label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
.controls label.inline { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
.controls input[type=number] { width: 80px; }
.controls input[type=text] { width: 260px; }
input, select, button { font: inherit; color: var(--text); background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 8px; }
button { cursor: pointer; }
button:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.status { color: var(--muted); margin: 6px 0 0; }
.error { color: #b3261e; }
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(420px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
.grid > div { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; min-height: 460px; }
.bottom { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(300px, 1fr); gap: 14px; align-items: start; }
.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 0.85rem; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 4px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); white-space: nowrap; }
th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; }
tr.hit { cursor: pointer; }
tr.hit.current { background: var(--row); }
tr.hit.marked td:first-child { box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent); }
.pager { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); }
.mol { background: #fff; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; }
.mol svg { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
.cards { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }
.card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px; width: 190px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
.card .mol { margin-bottom: 4px; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.tag { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 6px; font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 0 4px 2px 0; }
.tag.on { border-color: #eb6834; color: #eb6834; }
code { background: var(--code); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 0.85em; word-break: break-all; }
footer { color: var(--muted); text-align: center; padding: 0 16px 32px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .bottom { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>{{ meta.title }}</h1>
  <p>Browse the triaged hits, the building blocks and the resynthesis shortlist of a DEL screen. Everything runs in your browser.
    {% if meta.get('report_url') %}<a href="{{ meta.report_url }}">Full report</a>.{% endif %}</p>
  <p>Data derived from KinDEL: <a href="{{ meta.license_url }}">{{ meta.license }}</a>, non-commercial. Results carry that license.</p>
</header>
<main>
  <section aria-label="Filters and search">
    <div class="controls">
      <label>Screen <select id="screen"></select></label>
      <fieldset id="tiers" style="border:0;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end"></fieldset>
      <label>Flag <select id="flag"></select></label>
      <label>Min. Poisson lower bound <input id="min-lb" type="number" min="0" step="0.5" value="0"></label>
      <label>Min. target count <span><input id="min-count" type="range" min="0" max="10" value="0"> <output id="min-count-value">0</output></span></label>
      <label class="inline"><input id="picks-only" type="checkbox"> Shortlist only</label>
    </div>
    <div class="controls" style="margin-top:10px">
      <label>Search <input id="query" type="text" placeholder="SMARTS or SMILES, e.g. S(=O)(=O)N" autocomplete="off"></label>
      <label>Mode <select id="mode">
        <option value="sub">Building blocks containing</option>
        <option value="sim">Hits similar to</option>
      </select></label>
      <label>Min. similarity <input id="min-sim" type="number" min="0.1" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.4"></label>
      <button id="search" type="button">Search</button>
      <button id="clear-search" type="button">Clear search</button>
      <span style="flex:1"></span>
      <button id="clear-marks" type="button">Clear marks</button>
      <button id="export" type="button">Export marked as CSV</button>
    </div>
    <p id="status" class="status" role="status"></p>
  </section>

  <div class="grid">
    <div id="scatter" aria-label="Poisson lower bound against target count"></div>
    <div id="cube" aria-label="Building-block cube of the hits"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 14px">Mark hits with the box or lasso tool in the scatter plot, by clicking a point in the cube,
    or with the checkbox in the table. Marked hits get a ring in both plots.</p>

  <section id="blocks-panel" hidden aria-label="Matching building blocks">
    <h2>Building blocks matching the search</h2>
    <p id="blocks-summary" class="muted"></p>
    <div id="blocks" class="cards"></div>
  </section>

  <div class="bottom">
    <section aria-label="Hits">
      <h2>Hits</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table id="hits"></table></div>
      <div class="pager"><button id="prev" type="button">Previous</button><span id="page-info"></span><button id="next" type="button">Next</button></div>
    </section>
    <aside id="detail" aria-label="Selected compound"><h2>Compound</h2><p class="muted">Click a row or a point.</p></aside>
  </div>
</main>
<footer>
  {% if meta.get('pipeline_url') %}<a href="{{ meta.pipeline_url }}">{{ meta.get('pipeline', '') }}</a> {{ meta.get('version', '') }}{% endif %}
  · structures by <a href="https://github.com/rdkit/rdkit-js">RDKit.js</a>, plots by <a href="https://plotly.com/javascript/">plotly.js</a>
</footer>
<script id="payload" type="application/json">{{ data | safe }}</script>
<script>window.DELT_CONFIG = {{ {"rdkitJs": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@rdkit/rdkit@" ~ rdkit_version ~ "/dist/RDKit_minimal.js", "rdkitWasm": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@rdkit/rdkit@" ~ rdkit_version ~ "/dist/RDKit_minimal.wasm"} | tojson }};</script>
<script>{{ plotly_js | safe }}</script>
<script>{{ app_js | safe }}</script>
</body>
</html>
